      "side": 1,
      "message": "Jiyong my understanding is that these symbols come from source and not stubs and therefore the information contained in map.txt files is a no-op here\n\nAs an example, `NativeLoaderFreeErrorMessage` is a symbol in `libnativeloader.map.txt`, and is used in `frameworks/base/core/jni/android_app_NativeActivity.cpp`. But ninja reveals that we do not compile this using stubs generated from map.txt file.\n\n\n```\n# Use ninja to determine if there is a dep path between .o file map.txt file\n$ prebuilts/build-tools/linux-x86/bin/ninja -f out/combined-aosp_cf_arm64_phone.ninja -t path out/soong/.intermediates/frameworks/base/core/jni/libandroid_runtime/android_arm64_armv8-a_cortex-a53_shared/obj/frameworks/base/core/jni/android_app_NativeActivity.o art/libnativeloader/libnativeloader.map.txt\n\nninja: error \u003c.o\u003e does not depend on \u003c.map.txt\u003e\n```\n\nIt does depend on source\n```\n$ prebuilts/build-tools/linux-x86/bin/ninja -f out/combined-aosp_cf_arm64_phone.ninja -t path out/soong/.intermediates/frameworks/base/core/jni/libandroid_runtime/android_arm64_armv8-a_cortex-a53_shared/obj/frameworks/base/core/jni/android_app_NativeActivity.o frameworks/base/core/jni/android_app_NativeActivity.cpp\nout/soong/.intermediates/frameworks/base/core/jni/libandroid_runtime/android_arm64_armv8-a_cortex-a53_shared/obj/frameworks/base/core/jni/android_app_NativeActivity.o\nframeworks/base/core/jni/android_app_NativeActivity.cpp\n```\n\nDo you think this enforcement mechanism will be introduced in the future? If so, I can drop this statement from this CL.",
